{"id":8419915,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-nn/merge_requests/2831","number":2831,"state":"merged","title":"商分修复GatherElementsV2非尾轴场景同步错误","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-nn/pulls/2831","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-nn/pulls/2831/issues","body":"## 描述\n<!--在这里详细描述你的改动，包括改动的原因和所采取的方法。-->\n在GatherProcess增加MTE3到Vector的同步，确保多轮计算数据正确\n## 关联的Issue\n<!-- 如果这个PR是为了解决特定的Issue，请在这里提供Issue链接。例如：关联Issue #000-->\n关联Issue [#1542](https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-nn/issues/1542) \n## 测试\n<!--描述进行了哪些测试来验证你的改动。-->\n算子泛化1890个用例通过\n典型case复现脚本，修改后输出为True\n```python\nimport torch, torch_npu\nx = torch.randn(8192, 128, dtype=torch.float32)\nindex = torch.randint(0, 8192, size=(8192, 8,)).to(torch.int32)\nout_npu = torch.gather(x.npu(), 0, index.npu())\nout_cpu = torch.gather(x, 0, index.to(torch.int64))\nprint(f\"结果是否一致：{torch.equal(out_cpu, out_npu.cpu())}\")\n```\n\n## 文档更新\n<!--如果这个PR包含文档的更新，请在这里指出。例如：更新了README.md文件。-->\nNA\n## 类型标签\n<!--  [x] 表示选中 -->\n- [x] Bug修复\n- [ ] 新特性\n- [ ] 性能优化\n- [ ] 文档更新\n- [ ] 其他，请描述：\n\n\n","assignees_number":8,"assignees":[{"id":"6822cc0d6a68fa1fec6cc502","login":"zhou-qilong","name":"sunday","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6880d13aba419813105ac7ab","login":"tangweiwei2","name":"tangweiwei2","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c65c6a68fa1fec6cc32e","login":"crystalhu","name":"胡碧霞","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/crystalhu","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68c267402134ad667af2b58f","login":"wangyongguang","name":"wangyongguang","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wangyongguang","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6861e48dadc5e31e4da8818d","login":"chenqi317","name":"chenqi317","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/chenqi317","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c634e4b985165b4b055f"